TPLUS adds DeepSeek Harness support and exact-turn-result handling,
and uses the T3 Code TPLUS name and com.verduona.t3code-tplus bundle id.
TPLUS desktop releases use manual installation; no automatic update
feed is configured. The upstream project does not publish these builds.

Provenance: official upstream v0.0.42 is commit
719a76ca1dbf5490f1aa33ffb9966301e02be9a9. The fork's actual upstream
base is 7445aa733ada33e45289e5aa5055f79142556513, which includes 188
additional upstream commits. Nine fork commits precede the tplus.2
packaging remediation. Third-party dependency notices remain separate.
